    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The garden must grow! Transform a dead world into a thriving biosphere with the power of bees!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your ecosystem </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use flowers to supply, direct, and even clone your bees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up your beehive to craft wax and honey </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022270/extras/46f8aa486b4083d7c6fd9ccde6703dae.poster.avif?t=1733927157\" width=616 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022270/extras/46f8aa486b4083d7c6fd9ccde6703dae.webm?t=1733927157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022270/extras/46f8aa486b4083d7c6fd9ccde6703dae.mp4?t=1733927157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rearrange and optimize</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select, move, copy, and paste freely and smoothly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No enemies, manual grinding, or time pressure</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022270/extras/02f30ed83de8813a3a7dea840474aea6.poster.avif?t=1733927157\" width=616 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022270/extras/02f30ed83de8813a3a7dea840474aea6.webm?t=1733927157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022270/extras/02f30ed83de8813a3a7dea840474aea6.mp4?t=1733927157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Research everything</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascend an extensive research tree</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock flowers, frogs, fungi, and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022270/extras/57fa53ad912bd3069dcceb57ef7e461d.poster.avif?t=1733927157\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3022270/extras/57fa53ad912bd3069dcceb57ef7e461d.webm?t=1733927157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
